Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelfth Episode\NThe Prince and the Gypsy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see Prince Sapphire is\Ncoming! Good morning, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless! Were you\Ntrying to kill yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that\Nyou almost ran me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's the one who ran right at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's really the case, I\Napologize for my friend's mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? So you already know each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, fortunately,\Nhe didn't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?\NIt seems the opposite to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you kidding?!\N- Listen here, pretty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you? You hurt my\Nfriend and you dare to laugh in his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, not tickling! Stop it!\N- Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- But where did he go?\N- Where did he disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- He was right there!\N- Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, because he\Nis the Prince of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! A Prince should\Nbe much more elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, you don't seem\Nvery well-dressed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it doesn't matter to me.\NI am a gypsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gypsy? What is the characteristic\Nof a gypsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.26,0:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gypsies are nomads.\NMy people are always on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to make a living,\Nwe go around singing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,doing magic tricks\Nor stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your parents\Ngypsies too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they were,\Nbut they died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love\Nto be a Prince too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to have\Na palace all to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become\Nthe master of a palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of\Nme? I don't have a penny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I become\Nthe owner of a palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, for one day,\Nyou will be able to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan\Nto do, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- See?\N- May I know what you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Like this, now,\Nhe looks a lot like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reading a book called\N"The Prince and the Pauper".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is! It's the story\Nof a Prince and a beggar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...who switch roles.\NA beautiful story!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make it a reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I now know a poor\Nboy, I will swap roles with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you up for it, Jin?\N- I want to see what will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez! How long are they going to take\Nto change?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn! Dressed like that, I don't\Nrecognize them! They look identical to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will change our lives!\NDo you agree, Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm going to eat right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Where are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! Where are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally free!\NI'll be able to do whatever I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And no etiquette! Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to play all the time!\NNo more studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that rude person\Nwho knocked over my sign?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Sapphire!\NPlease, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been kidnapped\Nby the street urchins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!\NAre you by any chance friends with this flea?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! You mustn't bully\Nthe weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want me to teach you a lesson?\N- Boss, make him fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea! If you want to bring\Nthis kid back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- you'll have to beat me!\N- Do I have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then come on! Bring it on!\N- I'm going to have fun, rookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Aiuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help us!\N- Come on! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!\NIt's true, you can touch the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're even! Shall we do another\Ntry? - Yes, I'm up for it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I'm capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you see?\N- And now look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well done! Excellent!\N- Really funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi! How is it going? Why aren't you answering?\NDon't you know that I am the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must respect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You must reply to my greeting\Nwith the utmost deference!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To those maidens\NI must look very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, they want to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, look at that beautiful sunset!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's beautiful, but now I have to go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, Sapphire! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,\Ncould I have some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's you, Jin! Thank\Ngoodness you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought you had left us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin, I want to tell your fortune. Let's\Nsee what destiny has in store for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So: one, five, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put this one here, this other\None here, then like this and then..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear Jin, your card is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this card,\Nyou're a girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,By now I've become\Ntoo old!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My magic doesn't work anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brother, I'm glad\Nthat you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved some food for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you two going? Today he\Ndidn't even earn a single cent,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so he is only entitled to\Nhalf a portion, if he wants it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he doesn't want it, all the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized that you are not Jin.\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jin's sister! I won't tell\Nanyone that you're not the real Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but please,\Ntell me where he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Jin and I have\Nswapped roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he plays the Prince\Ninstead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? But that is magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here's Lizzie! Hello! You know, this\Nlittle sparrow is my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Every evening he returns to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is it already evening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, how late it has gotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be dark soon\Nand Sapphire is still nowhere to be seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here's Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to do a lot of things\Nat the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My loyal followers, I will give you\Nwhat remains of the potion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...that can reveal\Nif Sapphire is male or female!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Try not to fail this time!\N- We put the liquid...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...on the tips of the swords,\Nso, if we touch a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- he will turn blue!\N- If we touch a girl, red!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If we touch a man, yellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to surround him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon's assassins!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want? Don't you know\Nthat I am the Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely! We were just\Nwaiting for you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running away! Chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,End of the line, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\Nit was just a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That was only water!\NLift your face a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just water?\N- But you're a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm a boy! Why?\NWhat's strange about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! But then..! Then..!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin must already be\Nwaiting for me. Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Alarm! Alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin, you know you can't\Nleave here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to sleep immediately,\Notherwise it'll be worse for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, repeat that once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is so, Grand Duke: the Prince\Nturns out to be male!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there must be something\Nwrong with the potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have tested that potion\Nseveral times...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,..and it has always turned out to be\Nhighly effective!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! If the Prince is\Nreally a boy, I am ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!\NNylon, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir!\N- The only thing left is to kill Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not that simple\Nwith that little devil, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can believe it! With those idiots\Nat your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why you must win\Nthe trust of the gypsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm beginning to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not what you think!\NI had no intention of running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to send the real Jin\Nback among you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We exchanged clothes\Nto try a different life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He was able to spend\Na day in my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,because I am the Prince\Nof Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I hearing?! Hey,\Nfriends! Did you hear that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin has gone crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true! I am a real Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Macigno,\Nforgive my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong?! He wanted to sneak off\Nso he wouldn't have to work anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,On this,\Nthe law of the gypsies is drastic:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,no forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will work hard\Nand earn for him too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you promise to work\Nfor him as well, then things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boys!\NCut Pepita's ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You will go to the city to\Nsell this bundle of firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have to go to the city right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sell this bundle before\Ndawn, I will free your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to sell it!\NHow can he sell it at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If he fails to sell it,\Nyou will be hanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith, brother.\NI will definitely sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared! The\Nforest is terrible at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never make it, my little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Selling firewood!\NDo you want firewood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to buy firewood?\NI have a bundle of firewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My firewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.14,0:16:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try to get it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help me! I'm drowning!\N- I hear screams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!\NThat girl is in danger of drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help!\N- I will save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand! Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't make it on my own...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, friend lightning,\Ngive me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, friend!\NI will always be grateful to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Please, open your eyes!\NDon't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die! I helped you!\NYou must go on living!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord!\NPlease, Lord, save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never asked you for anything,\Nbut now I beg you:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,do me this favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful,\NI saw my mother in a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this? It must be\Na gift she gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jin! Pepita hasn't returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If she doesn't come back before\Ndawn, I'll play a nasty trick on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Pepita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gold!\NLook how it shines!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can free Jin now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pepita, I'm so happy!\N- I'm happy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Macigno, I\Nhave something to ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want! I\Nknow your master pays well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get a lot of\Nmoney, if you kill the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Jin will get\Ncaught in the middle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince, this morning, will\Ntake a walk with Baron Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You will ambush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You will take care of it\Nyourself with four of your men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A Prince should be worth\Na tidy sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! Nick and Jaguar!\N- Yes, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cutty and Sal!\N- Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, boys,\Nwe must not fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, Jin is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, please,\Nhelp my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jin were to die,\NI would die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My little Lizzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pepita!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help your brother\Nand you'll see he won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A long morning walk\Nis a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think, Prince? I am\Nhonored to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I already feel a bit tired. I would\Nprefer to return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a nice race to\Nthe castle, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How distracted that Nylon is!\NHe went in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, Prince! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jin, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time, Prince!\NThank goodness you arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NWhat does this brat want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gypsies!\N- Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- They are here!\N- For all the devils in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Jin!\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go back! Go!\N- Sorry to disappoint you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not going back at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so? Now you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Prince!\NYou're just as strong as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the assassins?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The end they deserved!\NThey're down there, over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.66,0:23:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell me, did you like it\Nat the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.74,0:23:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there is nothing interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you? Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, "fun"\Nisn't the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm glad\Nto have been among the gypsies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.06,0:23:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's time to say goodbye.\NPepita is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But then the real Prince\Nwas the fake Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the one who was Prince\Nwas not the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.06,0:24:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand anything anymore,\Ndamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:36.84,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:40.20,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:40.20,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
