Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:50.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k41}{\k46}Sen{\k38}'nen {\k52}man{\k41}'nen {\k34}hya{\k25}ku{\k33}man{\k38}-nen{\k33}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:50.95,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:54.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:54.25,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:58.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k33}{\k33}A{\k22}ku{\k25}ma {\k17}ga {\k35}ku{\k36}te {\k24}mo {\k19}a{\k18}ra{\k30}shi {\k11}ga {\k36}ku{\k33}te {\k28}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:58.25,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.25,0:25:01.69,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}tsu{\k17}na{\k27}i{\k21}da {\k17}ko{\k21}ko{\k29}ro {\k16}wa {\k22}ha{\k32}na{\k26}re{\k14}na{\k79}i
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.25,0:25:01.69,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Our bonded hearts will never part.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.69,0:25:05.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
